msgid "this capability has been removed as of ArduPilot version 4.5 and later. See instead :ref:`common-oem-customizations`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:9
#: 12c04276f82b4fa0adb8d4b1c1ce3a22
msgid "`APJ Tools <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/scripts/apj_tool.py>`__ is a command-line `Python <https://www.python.org/downloads/>`__ program which can be used to add custom default parameter values to a pre-built ArduPilot firmware.  It can also mark these parameters as read-only to avoid users accidentally overwriting them.  This can help companies reduce the time required to set up many identical vehicles."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:11
#: bdb62c07a5b245aebab428211dca3ecb
msgid "Additional customization options are possible by creating a new build target for a specific vehicle. :ref:`OEM Customization<common-oem-customizations>`"
msgstr ""

